  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2&#160;</mn><mo>+&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1&#160;</mn><mo>-&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Multiplying the denominator by its conjugate, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6&#160;</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4&#160;</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>To make it purely imaginary. Its real part should be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6&#160;</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
